<LegalPage title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How DealsSite earns money from affiliate links and advertising.">
  <p>DealsSite is free to use. We earn money in two ways.</p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some links to brands are affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, we may receive a commission from the brand. It does not change the price you pay.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>We show ads through Google AdSense and similar networks. Ads are labelled and are separate from the offers we list.</p>

  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <p>A commission does not decide whether an offer is listed. We aim to show offers that are useful to visitors and we link to the brand's official page so you can verify the price.</p>

  <p>Questions? See our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
